data DocTxt chars
  "I HAVE THREATENED TO TELL   "
  "THE POLICE ALL THAT I KNOW  "
  "ABOUT THEIR CRIMINAL        "
  "ACTIVITIES IF ANY OF THESE  "
  "PEOPLE DOESN'T PAY ME       "
  "ANOTHER $9000 BY            "
  "MIDNIGHT SUNDAY...          "
  "I HEREBY BEQUEATH ONE       "
  "HUNDRED MILLION DOLLARS TO  "
  "EACH OF THESE LOYAL AND     "
  "FAITHFUL FRIENDS...         "
  "DEAR DIARY---               "
  "I FOUND ANOTHER ANONYMOUS   "
  "LETTER IN THE MAIL THIS     "
  "MORNING. MY LIFE IS IN      "
  "DANGER FROM A JEALOUS       "
  "LUNATIC. THE HANDWRITING    "
  "COULD BE THAT OF ANY OF     "
  "THESE PEOPLE...             "
end data
